message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MetaInformAnt"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/MetaInformAnt"
abstract: "METAINFORMANT is a Python multi-omic bioinformatics toolkit for DNA, RNA-seq, protein, epigenome and single-cell analysis, GWAS with fine-mapping and eQTL, joint PCA and a broad plot-type library — uv-managed and tested, demoed on multi-species sample data."
license: Apache-2.0
